  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3004.03 Public Notice Procedures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3004.03 Public Notice Procedures. Prior to issuing an ERC certificate to any person having certified ERCs, the department shall follow the same procedures for public notice and hearing as the department follows for issuing permits in accordance with Env-A 621.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
